<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2013/Brown-Cow.jpg" alt="A portrait of a brown and white Angus cow" width="400" height="571" /></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">I found some holstein cown just across the river in Maryland, but they were not at all cooperative about having their picture taken. &nbsp;So I stuck with the herd that I found earlier in the summer and made a painting from the photos I took at the side of the road in Purcellville. I've offered this painting up for a show at the Berkley Gallery in Warrenton in October this year.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Pasture Fed. &nbsp;Oil on linen, 11"x16". 2013.</p>